{
    "title": "Bible King James Fran\u00e7aise",
    "description": "French King James Bible is a free download application for Android, designed to read and explore the Bible for free on your phone.\r\nStart your project to know the Bible with the best Bible app. The French King James Bible is a faithful French translation of the King James Bible, the most famous Bible in English. The KJV Bible is recognized as the pure word of God in English.\r\nDownload this French translation based on the most widely read Bible in the world and enjoy these features, all free:\r\n\r\nDO YOU WANT TO KNOW THE ADVANTAGES OF THIS APPLICATION?\r\n- This application is free and works without an internet connection. Wherever you are, in the office, in the car, on the road or on a trip abroad, you always have access to your Bible\r\n-Audio Bible: You have the choice of reading the texts or listening to them. When you want, you can listen to a passage from the Bible. In public transport, while traveling or for a few minutes of contemplation at home.\r\n\r\nCONVENIENT OPTIONS TO HELP YOU USE YOUR BIBLE:\r\n\r\n- You can mark verses and create a list of favorites\r\n- Add notes and perform keyword searches\r\n- You can change the font size\r\n- Activate night mode to read at night\r\n- The app remembers where you stopped your reading the day before\r\n- You can share verses directly from the app on Facebook, Twitter or Instagram\r\n- You can also send them directly by WhatsApp, by e-mail or by SMS\r\n- Also you can create images with verses to send\r\n- Receive daily inspiration with the verse of the day. Start your day with the energy of God. You can receive them every day or only on Sundays.\r\n\r\nAll features are free to enhance your Bible reading experience. Download it now!\r\nHere is the complete list of books in the French King James Bible:\r\nThe Old Testament: Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs , Ecclesiastes, Song of Songs, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi.\r\n\r\n\r\nNew Testament: Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation.",
    "descriptionHTML": "French King James Bible is a free download application for Android, designed to read and explore the Bible for free on your phone.<br>Start your project to know the Bible with the best Bible app. The French King James Bible is a faithful French translation of the King James Bible, the most famous Bible in English. The KJV Bible is recognized as the pure word of God in English.<br>Download this French translation based on the most widely read Bible in the world and enjoy these features, all free:<br><br>DO YOU WANT TO KNOW THE ADVANTAGES OF THIS APPLICATION?<br>- This application is free and works without an internet connection. Wherever you are, in the office, in the car, on the road or on a trip abroad, you always have access to your Bible<br>-Audio Bible: You have the choice of reading the texts or listening to them. When you want, you can listen to a passage from the Bible. In public transport, while traveling or for a few minutes of contemplation at home.<br><br>CONVENIENT OPTIONS TO HELP YOU USE YOUR BIBLE:<br><br>- You can mark verses and create a list of favorites<br>- Add notes and perform keyword searches<br>- You can change the font size<br>- Activate night mode to read at night<br>- The app remembers where you stopped your reading the day before<br>- You can share verses directly from the app on Facebook, Twitter or Instagram<br>- You can also send them directly by WhatsApp, by e-mail or by SMS<br>- Also you can create images with verses to send<br>- Receive daily inspiration with the verse of the day. Start your day with the energy of God. You can receive them every day or only on Sundays.<br><br>All features are free to enhance your Bible reading experience. Download it now!<br>Here is the complete list of books in the French King James Bible:<br>The Old Testament: Genesis, Exodus, Leviticus, Numbers, Deuteronomy, Joshua, Judges, Ruth, 1 Samuel, 2 Samuel, 1 Kings, 2 Kings, 1 Chronicles, 2 Chronicles, Ezra, Nehemiah, Esther, Job, Psalms, Proverbs , Ecclesiastes, Song of Songs, Isaiah, Jeremiah, Lamentations, Ezekiel, Daniel, Hosea, Joel, Amos, Obadiah, Jonah, Micah, Nahum, Habakkuk, Zephaniah, Haggai, Zechariah, Malachi.<br><br><br>New Testament: Matthew, Mark, Luke, John, Acts, Romans, 1 Corinthians, 2 Corinthians, Galatians, Ephesians, Philippians, Colossians, 1 Thessalonians, 2 Thessalonians, 1 Timothy, 2 Timothy, Titus, Philemon, Hebrews, James, 1 Peter, 2 Peter, 1 John, 2 John, 3 John, Jude, Revelation.",
